select 'personality-disorders', 'Personality psychology: Type and trait theories', 'Briggs and Myers also added another personality dimension to the MBTI to measure whether a person prefers to use a judging or perceiving function when interacting with the external world. Therefore, they included questions designed to indicate whether someone wishes to come to conclusions (judgement) or to keep options open (perception).', 'Wikipedia: Personality psychology', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Personality_psychology&oldid=1377262098', 'CC BY-SA 4.0. Wikipedia contributors (see page history). Excerpted and split into passages.'
where not exists (select 1 from public.content_chunks where topic_id = 'personality-disorders' and body = 'Briggs and Myers also added another personality dimension to the MBTI to measure whether a person prefers to use a judging or perceiving function when interacting with the external world. Therefore, they included questions designed to indicate whether someone wishes to come to conclusions (judgement) or to keep options open (perception).');
